  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multisectoral Support to Respond to Needs of Refugees and Host Communities in the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">One and a half years into the Ukrainian crisis, the Government of the Republic of Moldova is still challenged to address the critical needs of the refugees from Ukraine seeking temporary protection on its territory and struggles to stabilize the country&#x2019;s economy aggravated by the war and the energy crisis affecting its citizens. 
 
The overall objective of the proposed response is to contribute to addressing the critical multisectoral needs of refugees and vulnerable Moldovans and increase the resilience of communities in the fragile context of the Republic of Moldova. The proposed interventions aim to increase refugees&#x2019; and vulnerable Moldovans&#x2019; access to services, strengthen social cohesion, and support institutions to implement durable solutions which integrate the needs of refugees and migrants.</narrative>
  </description>
